; kkz_adapter.def -- the three exports a KiriKiri Z plugin proxy must provide.
; V2Link / V2Unlink are called by the engine; GetModuleThreadModel is provided
; because the original plugins export it too.
; This template does NOT export DllGetClassObject or similar: it only replaces
; plain V2 plugins such as getSample.dll -- COM plugins (e.g. menu.dll) need a
; separate evaluation, see docs/35.
;
; KEEP THIS FILE ASCII-ONLY. build.log lesson (task-49): a .def whose comments
; contain UTF-8 CJK text makes link.exe print
;   warning LNK4017: V2Link <statement not supported for target platform>; ignored
; and then silently drop ALL exports -- the DLL links "fine" but is unusable.
EXPORTS
    V2Link
    V2Unlink
    GetModuleThreadModel
